   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Aktiviteten saknar beskrivning. Kontakta Sida f&#xf6;r mer information. Ring +46 8 698 50 00 eller skicka e-post till sida@sida.se.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Alliance for Health Policy and System Research aim at mapping and monitor HPSR activities in collaboration with various partners to identify gaps and research needs, as well as support capacity building of young researchers within HPSR. Since Alliance will evolve into WHO during 2006, a final year of funding has been agreed upon. Sida expect the proposal to come from WHO for 2006 and onwards.</narrative>
